%% Context: Continuous delivery pipeline with quality gates and production rollback.
flowchart LR
  A([Commit merged]) ==> B[Build artifact]
  B --> C{Build succeeds?}
  C -->|No| D[Notify developer]
  D -.-> A
  C -->|Yes| E[Run unit tests]
  E --> F{Tests pass?}
  F -->|No| D
  F -->|Yes| G{{Security scan}}
  G --> H{Findings acceptable?}
  H -->|No| D
  H -->|Yes| I[Deploy to staging]
  I --> J[Run integration tests]
  J --> K{Release approved?}
  K -->|No| L[Hold release]
  L -.-> K
  K -->|Yes| M[Deploy production]
  M --> N{Health checks pass?}
  N -->|Yes| O([Release complete])
  N -->|No| P[Rollback production]
  P --> Q([Incident opened])
